OL,3,GNEWSAThe health scare which made a
OL,4,Acompany director rethink his life
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt took a serious health scare for Mike
OL,7,FWatkins to realise his biggest lesson:
OL,8,F"Your life and your family and being
OL,9,Faround is more important than a job and
OL,10,Fan extension."
OL,12,FA director in the construction
OL,13,Findustry, the father-of-three suffered
OL,14,Fa seizure in B&Q soon after driving on
OL,15,Fthe M42 motorway.
OL,17,FHe was out with his wife and a daughter
OL,18,F"being dragged around different shops"
OL,19,Fbefore ending up at a B&Q outlet in
OL,20,FShirley, Solihull.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
