OL,3,GNEWSAThe health scare which made a
OL,4,Acompany director rethink his life
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I started to feel a little bit off. My
OL,7,Fhead suddenly vibrated and my wife
OL,8,Fturned round to me and said 'what was
OL,9,Fthat?'," he remembered.
